    {
      "id": "34f43754-9848-403d-8652-3ec53148c688",
      "title": "Depois da sessão",
      "description": "<p>Duas pessoas tentam comentar o atrito sem escolher um vilão de imediato.</p>",
      "contentType": 7,
      "sequenceItem": 6,
      "items": [],
      "dialogue_bubbles": [
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Bruno es un cielo, pero hoy está a la defensiva.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">O Bruno é um amor, mas hoje está na defensiva.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/13bb07a0d53042f8bc63509ad0cd437f_b04-bruno-es-un-cielo-pero-hoy-esta-a-la-defensiva.mp3?Expires=1794099864&Signature=JeB-~Uzu6Iqhj8V~2RONiEBMZqnj0Hhqjli5tqQuL9~4AtEbRkevxMRSr8c9MQGi9lq-jmiGlp2xKYN1JCbCvxYV6pTGbTCRDaalfaGIIZyzHzfmVIiZuHa7D~EpGoKEL5~-yndCP6-GT3U1m1-dO~f8~TefYPBTpM7Uis1Gs7-cmKgX~nZx9mibGEVZiyhCIXUb0Q5LyQ13tysloRC18RfsEhmYt4S7nJAQgfnWVqMBc6i25fTwNdjegQLEtGbCc1ems~W3eyJzpa58gfl6-wVneF~sd91nDLDjIs1B6uI0WKtkmrowBxdhucqonrX9L-jTly26BGdkJ~zs~xCibw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Sí, y hay bastante de malentendido y muy poco de mala fe.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Sim, e ha bastante mal-entendido e muito pouca ma-fe.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/07292899e80144bebad807d3a6fb02f3_C1_M003_L05_audio_d4dba8e2_b02-hay-bastante-de-malentendido-y-muy-poco-de-mala-fe.mp3?Expires=1794099864&Signature=0St-IA9g~JZbaN-a5HnfAWoCVnu0EX5AbziqDaONpU8IuXlPtJBGMipSkv2hTpF-0iRuM2ttBDGl2~LlP3sbz0awaMaMGAPlNJPtH1BDJTLShZQp1brlHAJHjOkqQ4~0e7pVIPdYxivY1uwiC0ylT2cEkxmRJUImOOKswMSDJGJzEA-V6LZje7NiLFOxlu4Pln9j5Ob~hqHH9NKfVgc~rFrneOZwHT90Kb5PCY0PIN8SCd0mJ4UOXMVWyMcrOf2EPpZnHAwmL7PBZdWg7VVFbQsbvc8QncVDID54tix8sxccdzGLRqMQhJov5PrurTlmkZ67IhW3gkOtwTmiI1Lfmw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Nora tiene bastante amor propio, por eso le molestó tanto el tono.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">A Nora tem bastante amor-próprio, por isso o tom a incomodou tanto.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/015443d0c212432d819a1cb1ff5d7d9e_b06-d03-nora-tiene-bastante-amor-propio.mp3?Expires=1794099864&Signature=QAKJ5PRMV5eZYnDnTklyv35kPHAXFZmvSD9k3kybml~WKz5bb5fzzRzYLuuSaeZAJZVxFwOrQHiPBiGwqBR1vKpvhZXduvvM291KhlNkSChMO9~ZKueoi6VJP~WuZ4tswESAZYlrvzbVToLcDhss2u5Nr674elUzjZ0yASM0GM2Je36j212s5fRjrwr~GaEB9gTqfWkwb~mq2zGuJD9F~EY3BrTHhqMJurqQz4lVj-DpBMRFXuG2yD74SDs-o~zL0gCMaR5eG6wzXsfMjMwSD4ZZz1Tm3kxCN8NyvtEbVKGABNO9yRA97omRcBMCHTvVUIZR-yqOG~rBsHG3ko8mFw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Entonces conviene hablar con calma y separar lo que pasó de cómo estaban.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Então convem falar com calma e separar o que aconteceu de como eles estavam.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/f7400e08e24e40429885db36de2c7d78_C1_M003_L05_audio_d6bf3dcd_b06-d04-entonces-conviene-hablar-con-calma.mp3?Expires=1794099864&Signature=GUVnsEoyt6a5aqj-0tSS-wIliQ~JnBLich~2aM-LYCEGY1EBKlBhZwHIwV5mmSHcGIigOUPNrXufLqpCkVQhoUCblFm7MZ2Uat627cSCBdc3UxjrIj5V~mAJy5G3AQMNSqikkGG9M7kq8nfqbp~8Acdnn1cEq8HjZk1xwSunhyE6IrmxLYCDejKq~Oby9OqQN9-9z9gJvxOo7kwv0IbdJ9K~4KyWfvgtmQhbgd7UPNjjpg8Rl3rwgN7-u5~Kf5ycjNMRkkrodu8zFyyc1fL1NV9QmF-6L2WXmq8ozUwYyuN2d8z~bhTUw4NYnosLQJ-Sy9245gz51YEI7b45krDo7g__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        }
      ],
      "glossary": null
